# Do not store real values in this repository.
#
# The E2E runner defaults to /home/ntd/meeting_runtime/.env, which is the one
# existing private runtime configuration for native WSL AI/Agent processes.
# To use another private file, export MEETING_E2E_BASE_ENV=/absolute/path.env.
#
# That file must contain the following existing runtime variables:
# LIVEKIT_URL=wss://livekit.example.vn
# LIVEKIT_API_KEY=...
# LIVEKIT_API_SECRET=...
# INTERNAL_API_KEY=at-least-24-random-characters
# OLLAMA_URL=http://127.0.0.1:11434
# MINUTES_COMPOSER_ENABLED=true
# MINUTES_COMPOSER_MODE=llm
# MINUTES_COMPOSER_MODEL=qwen2.5:3b
#
# The runner derives MEETING_SERVICE_KEY from INTERNAL_API_KEY, so there is no
# second service-key copy to drift out of sync.
